select app.guide_release_section('renter', 'start-here', 'start', null, '### Who this guide is for

Anyone who rents a car from CarmaCars. You can send a request without an account. Your account keeps your trips, offers, agreements, receipts and documents in one place.

### What you need

- A G or G2 licence (licences from outside Ontario are reviewed by a person)
- A credit card in your own name
- Your email address and a mobile number

## Your first sign-in

1. Go to `carmacars.ca/create-account`. Enter your Full name, Email and a Password of 8 characters or more.
2. Tick the box to agree to the terms, then press **Create account**.
3. Open the email "Confirm your CarmaCars account" and press its link within 24 hours. It confirms your email and opens Trips.
4. Next time, sign in at `carmacars.ca/sign-in` with your email and password. Link expired? Sign in and press **Send a new confirmation link**.

![](/guides/img/public-10-create-account-phone-d6259c9c.jpg "phone; size: 390 740; pins: 2 95.4 97.0")

> Good to know: Sent a request before you had an account? Once your email is confirmed, those requests are added to your account and Trips says "We found earlier requests made with your email".

## Stuck on a page?

If you spend a few minutes on a page without anything saving, see the same error three times, or go back and forth between the same two steps, a small box asks **Need a hand with** the page. **Open the guide section** opens this guide at the right chapter beside the page (a sheet from the bottom on a phone); **Back to what I was doing** closes it and everything you typed is still there. **Not now** quiets it on that page for a day. It never shows while you pay or sign.

> Good to know: When we update our terms of use, our privacy policy or an agreement you signed with us, the next time you open your portal it shows **We''ve updated our terms**: a short summary of what changed and the new text. Tick that you read it and press **Accept** to continue. It does not change an agreement you already signed or a past booking.', 'Start here', 'Who this is for and your first sign-in.',
  '### Who this guide is for

Anyone who rents a car from CarmaCars. You can send a request without an account. Your account keeps your trips, offers, agreements, receipts and documents in one place.

### What you need

- A G or G2 licence (licences from outside Ontario are reviewed by a person)
- A credit card in your own name
- Your email address and a mobile number

## Your first sign-in

1. Go to `carmacars.ca/create-account`. Enter your Full name, Email and a Password of 8 characters or more.
2. Tick the box to agree to the terms, then press **Create account**.
3. Open the email "Confirm your CarmaCars account" and press its link within 24 hours. It confirms your email and opens Trips.
4. Next time, sign in at `carmacars.ca/sign-in` with your email and password. Link expired? Sign in and press **Send a new confirmation link**.

![](/guides/img/public-10-create-account-phone-d6259c9c.jpg "phone; size: 390 740; pins: 2 95.4 97.0")

> Good to know: Sent a request before you had an account? Once your email is confirmed, those requests are added to your account and Trips says "We found earlier requests made with your email".

## Stuck on a page?

If you spend a few minutes on a page without anything saving, see the same error three times, or go back and forth between the same two steps, a small box asks **Need a hand with** the page. **Open the guide section** opens this guide at the right chapter beside the page (a sheet from the bottom on a phone); **Back to what I was doing** closes it and everything you typed is still there. **Not now** quiets it on that page for a day. It never shows while you pay or sign.

> Good to know: When we update our terms of use, our privacy policy or an agreement you signed with us, the next time you open your portal it shows **We''ve updated our terms**: a short summary of what changed and the new text. Tick that you read it and press **Accept** to continue. It does not change an agreement you already signed or a past booking.

## Your name and password (release 34)
Open Profile. **Save my display name** changes how you are greeted, at once. Your legal name is the one on your signed agreements, so it is not edited freely: press **Request a name change**, write the full name and why, and an Admin approves it. Until then the name on file stays. To change your email, use Change my email under Sign-in; to add or change your phone, use the phone box under Sign-in (we text a code). **Change my password** sends you to the password page.',
