## Your name and password (release 34)
Open Profile. **Save my display name** changes how you are greeted, at once. Your legal name is the one on your signed agreements, so it is not edited freely: press **Request a name change**, write the full name and why, and an Admin approves it. Until then the name on file stays. To change your email, use Change my email under Sign-in; to add or change your phone, use the phone box under Sign-in (we text a code). **Change my password** sends you to the password page.',
  '<p class="gd-p">Report anything that happens on the road, add a rental for a renter you found, share your referral link, and keep your details up to date.</p><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-report-a-problem" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Report a problem</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Report a problem</b> and choose the Car.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Choose What happened: <b class="gd-ui">New damage found</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Warning light</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Collision while I was driving</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Ticket or toll while I was driving</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Lost property found</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Something else</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Write the Details: where, when and what you see.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Take a photo</b> for each photo, then <b class="gd-ui">Send the report</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/1040"><img src="/guides/img/field-03-report-phone-3b903b20.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="1040"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:93.6%;top:46.6%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:93.6%;top:64.9%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:93.6%;top:89.9%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box gd-box--warn"><span class="gd-lbl">Watch out</span><div>In a collision, make sure everyone is safe and call 911 if anyone is hurt. Then call CarmaCars at 289-312-5991 before you send the report.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-add-a-rental-for-a-renter-you-found" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Add a rental for a renter you found</h2><p class="gd-p">Your home address must be in your profile first: until it is, the page asks for it.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Add a rental</b>. Choose the car, the dates and the places, then type the renter&#39;s details. A renter already on file is found by their email. Car already out with the renter? Enter the pickup as when it left: it is recorded as on trip.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Check the calendar and the price</b>. To charge another price, type it with the reason: a price far under the rate sheet is flagged for an Admin, not refused.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Choose <b class="gd-ui">Send a payment link</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Charge the saved card when the renter signs</b>. The renter pays online: you take no payment for it yourself.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Under Who found this client, choose <b class="gd-ui">I sourced this client</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Entered for CarmaCars</b>, then press <b class="gd-ui">Add the rental</b>.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-commissions" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Commissions</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">You earn 10% of the rental charge (before tax, after discounts, less refunds) of each rental you sourced: one you added and marked I sourced this client, or a booking made with your referral link.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">It is earned when the rental is completed and paid in full, then an Admin approves it and it is paid on your pay date. Your home address must be in your profile: until it is, a commission waits as not earned yet.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">My sales</b> shows each commission: not earned yet, pending approval, approved, paid or reversed. A refund after payment comes off a later commission.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-referrals-and-profile" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Referrals and profile</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Referrals</b>: your own referral link. Press <b class="gd-ui">Copy the link</b>, or let someone scan its QR code. A booking made with it counts as a rental you sourced.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>: <b class="gd-ui">Save my phone</b>, your home address (<b class="gd-ui">Change my home address</b>), <b class="gd-ui">Pay details</b> (how you are paid: only the last 4 digits of an account number are shown again), <b class="gd-ui">Set up two-step sign-in</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Change my email</b> (a link goes to the new address and the old one is told), <b class="gd-ui">Change my password</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Sign out</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/920"><img src="/guides/img/field-04-profile-phone-f05000e2.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="920"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.3%;top:78.3%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-sign-in-with-your-phone-number" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Sign in with your phone number</h2><p class="gd-p">Quicker on a phone than a password: a 6-digit code by text.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, under Sign-in, press <b class="gd-ui">Add and verify my phone number</b>, enter your mobile number and press <b class="gd-ui">Text me a code</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Type the code from the text (it usually fills itself in) and press <b class="gd-ui">Verify</b>. Choose <b class="gd-ui">My phone number (a code by text)</b> under Sign in with.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Next time, the sign-in page opens on your phone number: press <b class="gd-ui">Text me a code</b> and enter the code. Two-step sign-in still asks for your authenticator code.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-texts-or-email" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Texts or email</h2><p class="gd-p">On <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, under <b class="gd-ui">Messages</b>, choose <b class="gd-ui">Email</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Text</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Both</b> for the messages we send you. Texts need the phone you verified above.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert the moment a job is assigned to you or changes, and when you are paid. Open <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b> and allow notifications. On an iPhone, add CarmaCars to the Home Screen first (Safari, <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>) and turn alerts on from there.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">The bell at the top opens <b class="gd-ui">Alerts</b>: your jobs assigned, changed and running late, and urgent alerts passed to you. With phone alerts on (<b class="gd-ui">Alerts</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Settings</b>), they reach your phone too, and at 8 am a short brief of your jobs that day. A late job alert has <b class="gd-ui">Mark picked up</b> (it opens the booking) and <b class="gd-ui">Snooze 30 min</b>. Quiet hours (9 pm to 8 am unless you change them) hold the ones that are not urgent.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-your-name-and-password-release-34" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your name and password (release 34)</h2><p class="gd-p">Open Profile. <b class="gd-ui">Save my display name</b> changes how you are greeted, at once. Your legal name is the one on your signed agreements, so it is not edited freely: press <b class="gd-ui">Request a name change</b>, write the full name and why, and an Admin approves it. Until then the name on file stays. To change your email, use Change my email under Sign-in; to add or change your phone, use the phone box under Sign-in (we text a code). <b class="gd-ui">Change my password</b> sends you to the password page.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('investor', 'profile-and-notices', 'chapter', 'statements', 'Your contact details, and the notices you can send us: how returns are handled, your bank account, and a transfer request.

## Contact details

Contact details shows your name, email, phone, address and bank account on file. To change your email, press **Change my email**: we send a link to the new address and tell the old one, and it changes when the link is opened. To update the rest, ask us; we confirm by phone.

## Change how returns are handled

1. Under How returns are handled, choose Paid monthly or Reinvested.
2. Press **Send the notice**. The change applies from the first Return Month that starts at least 10 days after we receive it.

![](/guides/img/investor-04-profile-phone-5e6b0e83.jpg "phone; size: 390 170")

## Bank account and transfers

1. To change the account we pay, press **Ask to change the bank account**. We call you at the number on file to take the new details. A change applies 10 days after notice.
2. To transfer an investment, choose it, fill in To (full name) and a Note, then press **Send the request**. A transfer needs CarmaCars'' written consent.
3. You see "Received. CarmaCars will confirm in writing." We confirm each request by email.

## Two-step sign-in (recommended)

1. At the bottom of Account, press **Set up two-step sign-in**.
2. Scan the code with your authenticator app.
3. Type the 6 digits and press **Continue**. From then on, every sign-in asks for a code.

Documents, further down the same page, lists your statements as files.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert on your phone or computer when a return is paid, a statement is ready or we send you a notice. Open **Account**, then under **Phone alerts** press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications. Choose the topics under **What to alert me about**. On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**) and turn alerts on from there.

## Delete my account

**Account**, **Delete my account**, then **Yes, delete my account**. An investment still under contract is settled first, as your agreement says; then we delete your account and email you. **Keep my account** withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.
', 'Account', 'Contact details, notices about returns and bank account, transfers, two-step sign-in.',
  'Your contact details, and the notices you can send us: how returns are handled, your bank account, and a transfer request.

## Contact details

Contact details shows your name, email, phone, address and bank account on file. To change your email, press **Change my email**: we send a link to the new address and tell the old one, and it changes when the link is opened. To update the rest, ask us; we confirm by phone.

## Change how returns are handled

1. Under How returns are handled, choose Paid monthly or Reinvested.
2. Press **Send the notice**. The change applies from the first Return Month that starts at least 10 days after we receive it.

![](/guides/img/investor-04-profile-phone-5e6b0e83.jpg "phone; size: 390 170")

## Bank account and transfers

1. To change the account we pay, press **Ask to change the bank account**. We call you at the number on file to take the new details. A change applies 10 days after notice.
2. To transfer an investment, choose it, fill in To (full name) and a Note, then press **Send the request**. A transfer needs CarmaCars'' written consent.
3. You see "Received. CarmaCars will confirm in writing." We confirm each request by email.

## Two-step sign-in (recommended)

1. At the bottom of Account, press **Set up two-step sign-in**.
2. Scan the code with your authenticator app.
3. Type the 6 digits and press **Continue**. From then on, every sign-in asks for a code.

Documents, further down the same page, lists your statements as files.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert on your phone or computer when a return is paid, a statement is ready or we send you a notice. Open **Account**, then under **Phone alerts** press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications. Choose the topics under **What to alert me about**. On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**) and turn alerts on from there.

## Delete my account

**Account**, **Delete my account**, then **Yes, delete my account**. An investment still under contract is settled first, as your agreement says; then we delete your account and email you. **Keep my account** withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.

## Your name and password (release 34)
Open Profile. **Save my display name** changes how you are greeted, at once. Your legal name is the one on your signed agreements, so it is not edited freely: press **Request a name change**, write the full name and why, and an Admin approves it. Until then the name on file stays. To change your email, use Change my email under Sign-in; to add or change your phone, use the phone box under Sign-in (we text a code). **Change my password** sends you to the password page.',
