estment, choose it, fill in To (full name) and a Note, then press <b class="gd-ui">Send the request</b>. A transfer needs CarmaCars&#39; written consent.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">You see &quot;Received. CarmaCars will confirm in writing.&quot; We confirm each request by email.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-two-step-sign-in-recommended" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Two-step sign-in (recommended)</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">At the bottom of Account, press <b class="gd-ui">Set up two-step sign-in</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Scan the code with your authenticator app.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Type the 6 digits and press <b class="gd-ui">Continue</b>. From then on, every sign-in asks for a code.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">Documents, further down the same page, lists your statements as files.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert on your phone or computer when a return is paid, a statement is ready or we send you a notice. Open <b class="gd-ui">Account</b>, then under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b> press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> and allow notifications. Choose the topics under <b class="gd-ui">What to alert me about</b>. On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>) and turn alerts on from there.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-delete-my-account" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Delete my account</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Account</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Yes, delete my account</b>. An investment still under contract is settled first, as your agreement says; then we delete your account and email you. <b class="gd-ui">Keep my account</b> withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-your-name-and-password-release-34" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your name and password (release 34)</h2><p class="gd-p">Open Profile. <b class="gd-ui">Save my display name</b> changes how you are greeted, at once. Your legal name is the one on your signed agreements, so it is not edited freely: press <b class="gd-ui">Request a name change</b>, write the full name and why, and an Admin approves it. Until then the name on file stays. To change your email, use Change my email under Sign-in; to add or change your phone, use the phone box under Sign-in (we text a code). <b class="gd-ui">Change my password</b> sends you to the password page.</p></section>');
